  "about_body": "Streak was born from a simple idea: why pay to track your own habits?\n\nThis app is completely open source. Anyone can see exactly how it works, suggest improvements, or even build their own version. No black boxes. No surprises.\n\nYour privacy is total — everything stays on your phone. No accounts, no servers, no ads. Not a single byte leaves your device.\n\nNo limits. Create as many habits as you want. No subscriptions, no \"pro version\", no pop-ups asking you to pay. Ever.\n\nIf the app brings you something, you can support it with a star on GitHub or by buying me a coffee. But it is completely optional — the app is yours either way.",
